e&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="640" width="360" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="qd" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;qb:DataSet&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;also dcat:Dataset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;border-top:1px solid #999999;margin:4px 0 2px 0&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;reported generation&lt;br&gt;estimated generation&lt;br&gt;dcterms:isPartOf → main dataset" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="670" width="300" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="un" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;qudt:Unit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;unit of measure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;border-top:1px solid #999999;margin:4px 0 2px 0&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;gigawatt hour for annual generation" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="830" width="360" height="60" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lg" value="&lt;b&gt;Notation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Yellow box: class, with its datatype properties&lt;br&gt;Arrow: object property&lt;br&gt;Dashed blue box: external resource&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#B85450&quot;&gt;Red: no suitable existing term, to be minted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#2E7D32&quot;&gt;Green: values taken from a gppd SKOS concept scheme (controlled list)&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalA